@startuml
title Phase 2 第 3 步实际依赖（尚无通用加载器）
package "main + host/DefaultHost" as host
package "cli（解析、分派）" as cli
package "application（事务、扩展调度）" as app
package "application/extensions（公开契约）" as api
package "domain（公开模型）" as domain
package "infrastructure（SVG 与 IO）" as io
package "plugins/builtin" as builtin
host --> cli
host --> app
host --> io
host --> builtin
cli --> app
cli --> api
app --> api
app --> domain
api --> domain
io --> app
io --> api
io --> domain
builtin --> api
builtin --> domain
note right of builtin
  六个 ShapeProvider 实例
  19 个注册命令
  无具体会话/工厂依赖
end note
note right of app
  AttributeService + TreeLabels
  工作副本成功后统一提交
end note
@enduml
